#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:326
msgid "Name of the worksheet."
msgstr "Kalkylbladets namn."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:334
msgid "Page number in the printing."
msgstr "Sidnummer i utskriften."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:342
msgid "Total number of pages in the printout."
msgstr "Utskriftens totala antal sidor."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:350
msgid ""
"Current date in format dd-mmm-yyyy. The format can be changed by specifying "
"the desired format in the opcode: <literal>&amp;[DATE:yyyy/mm/dd]</literal>."
msgstr ""
"Dagens datum i formatet dd-mmm-yyyy. Du kan ändra formatet genom att ange "
"önskat format i koden: <literal>&amp;[DATE:yyyy/mm/dd]</literal>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:360
msgid ""
"Current time in format hh:mm. The format can be changed by specifying the "
"desired format in the opcode: <literal>&amp;[TIME:hh:mm:ss]</literal>."
msgstr ""
"Aktuell tid i formatet hh:mm. Du kan ändra formatet genom att ange önskat "
"format i koden: <literal>&amp;[TIME:hh:mm:ss]</literal>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:370
msgid ""
"The basename of the file. For the file "
"<literal>/home/jdoe/file.gnumeric</literal>, this opcode prints "
"<literal>file.gnumeric</literal>."
msgstr ""
"Filens basnamn. För filen <literal>/home/jdoe/file.gnumeric</literal> "
"skriver den här koden ut <literal>file.gnumeric</literal>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:379
msgid ""
"The path of the file excluding the basename. For the file "
"<literal>/home/jdoe/file.gnumeric</literal>, this opcode prints "
"<literal>/home/jdoe/</literal>."
msgstr ""
"Sökvägen till filen utan basnamnet. För filen "
"<literal>/home/jdoe/file.gnumeric</literal> skriver den här koden ut "
"<literal>/home/jdoe/</literal>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:389
msgid ""
"The content of the cell <literal>$A$1</literal> on the sheet being printed. "
"Instead of <literal>$A$1</literal> any other absolutely addressed cell may "
"be used."
msgstr ""
"Innehållet i cellen <literal>$A$1</literal> på kalkylbladet som skrivs ut. "
"Du kan använda en annan absolut cellreferens i stället för "
"<literal>$A$1</literal>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:397
msgid ""
"The content of the top left cell on the current page. Instead of "
"<literal>A1</literal> any other relative cell address may be used. This "
"relative address is interpreted with respect to the top left cell on the "
"current page. Any repeating rows or columns are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Innehållet i den översta vänstra cellen på den aktuella sidan. Du kan "
"använda en annan relativ cellreferens i stället för <literal>A1</literal>. "
"Referensen tolkas i förhållande till den översta vänstra cellen på den "
"aktuella sidan. Upprepade rader och kolumner ignoreras."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:405
msgid ""
"The content of the top left cell on the current page. Instead of "
"<literal>A1</literal> any other relative cell address may be used. This "
"relative address is interpreted with respect to the top left cell on the "
"current page. Repeating rows or columns are not ignored. So if the top left "
"cell is in a repeating row or column then the relative address is "
"interpreted with respect to that cell."
msgstr ""
"Innehållet i den översta vänstra cellen på den aktuella sidan. Du kan "
"använda en annan relativ cellreferens i stället för <literal>A1</literal>. "
"Referensen tolkas i förhållande till den översta vänstra cellen på den "
"aktuella sidan. Upprepade rader och kolumner ignoreras inte. Om den översta "
"vänstra cellen till exempel ligger i en upprepad rad eller kolumn tolkas "
"referensen i förhållande till den cellen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:414
msgid ""
"You can choose the font in which the header and footer is printed by "
"selecting a default header/footer font in the preferences (see in <xref "
"linkend=\"sect-configuration-preferences\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Välj vilket typsnitt som ska användas för sidhuvud och sidfot genom att ange"
" ett standardtypsnitt för dem i inställningarna. Se <xref linkend=\"sect-"
"configuration-preferences\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:423
msgid ""
"Double clicking on the header or footer preview will quickly allow you to "
"customize that header or footer."
msgstr ""
"Dubbelklicka på förhandsgranskningen av sidhuvudet eller sidfoten för att "
"snabbt anpassa den."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:431
msgid "Page Setup Dialog - Print Area"
msgstr "Sidinställningar – Utskriftsområde"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:434
msgid "<interface>Print Setup Print Area Tab</interface>"
msgstr ""
"<interface>Fliken Utskriftsområde i utskriftsinställningarna</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:442
msgid ""
"You can select rows or columns to be printed on every page of the output. "
"This is commonly used for printing column or row names. To enable this, "
"enter the range of cells to be repeated in <guilabel>Rows to "
"repeat...</guilabel> or <guilabel>Columns to repeat...</guilabel> field. "
"Instead of entering them manually, you can also select columns or rows to be"
" repeated using the mouse."
msgstr ""
"Du kan välja rader eller kolumner som ska skrivas ut på varje sida. Det "
"används ofta för att upprepa namn på rader eller kolumner. Ange "
"cellintervallet som ska upprepas i fältet <guilabel>Rader att "
"upprepa...</guilabel> eller <guilabel>Kolumner att upprepa...</guilabel>. Du"
" kan också markera rader eller kolumner med musen i stället för att skriva "
"in intervallet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:454
msgid ""
"Note that the rows and columns must be entered as ranges. That is, if you "
"want to have first row repeated, you must enter <literal>1:1</literal>, not "
"just <literal>1</literal>. Similarly, to have column <literal>A</literal> "
"repeated, you must enter <literal>A:A</literal>."
msgstr ""
"Observera att rader och kolumner måste anges som intervall. Om du till "
"exempel vill upprepa den första raden måste du ange <literal>1:1</literal>, "
"inte bara <literal>1</literal>. På samma sätt anger du "
"<literal>A:A</literal> om du vill upprepa kolumn <literal>A</literal>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:467
msgid "Page Setup Dialog - Sheet"
msgstr "Sidinställningar – Kalkylblad"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:470
msgid "<interface>Print Setup Sheet Tab</interface>"
msgstr "<interface>Fliken Kalkylblad i utskriftsinställningarna</interface>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:479
msgid ""
"Select <guilabel>Grid lines</guilabel> to print the cell grid lines with "
"your document. Unselect the button to hide the grid lines from your print "
"output."
msgstr ""
"Markera <guilabel>Rutnät</guilabel> om du vill skriva ut cellernas "
"rutnätslinjer. Avmarkera alternativet om du vill dölja dem i utskriften."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:485
msgid ""
"Select <guilabel>Black and white</guilabel> to convert the colours in your "
"document to a greyscale range."
msgstr ""
"Markera <guilabel>Svartvitt</guilabel> om du vill skriva ut dokumentets "
"färger i gråskala."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:490
msgid ""
"Select <guilabel>Do not print with all sheets</guilabel> if you want to "
"avoid printing this sheet whenever you choose to print <guilabel>all "
"sheets</guilabel>. If this item is checked then this sheet will only be "
"printed as the active sheet or as part of a range of sheets. This is useful "
"if you have a non-hidden sheet that contains only auxillary information and "
"should normally not be printed."
msgstr ""
"Markera <guilabel>Skriv inte ut tillsammans med alla blad</guilabel> om "
"kalkylbladet inte ska skrivas ut när du väljer <guilabel>alla "
"kalkylblad</guilabel>. Då skrivs bladet bara ut om det är aktivt eller ingår"
" i ett intervall av kalkylblad. Det är användbart om ett synligt blad bara "
"innehåller kompletterande information som normalt inte ska skrivas ut."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:500
msgid ""
"Select <guilabel>Row and column headings</guilabel> to print the row and "
"column headings (1,2,3,... and A,B,C,...)."
msgstr ""
"Markera <guilabel>Rubriker för rader och kolumner</guilabel> om du vill "
"skriva ut dessa (1,2,3,... och A,B,C,...)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:505
msgid ""
"Select <guilabel>Styles with no content</guilabel> to ensure cells with "
"style changes will be printed, even if they are empty. For example, if you "
"have a number of cells with the background color changed but no data in "
"them, you can select this option to ensure they are in the printed output."
msgstr ""
"Markera <guilabel>Formatmallar utan innehåll</guilabel> om celler med "
"ändrade format ska skrivas ut även när de är tomma. Om du till exempel har "
"ändrat bakgrundsfärgen på tomma celler kan du markera det här alternativet "
"så att färgen kommer med i utskriften."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:521
msgid "Every error value is printed just as shown on the worksheet."
msgstr "Alla felvärden skrivs ut precis som de visas i kalkylbladet."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:529
msgid "No error values are printed."
msgstr "Felvärden skrivs inte ut."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:537
msgid ""
"Every error value is replaced by two m-dashes (separated by a thin space): "
"\"— —\"."
msgstr ""
"Varje felvärde ersätts med två tankstreck med ett tunt blanksteg emellan: ”—"
" —”."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:544
msgid "Print as NA"
msgstr "Skriv ut som #N/A"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:546
msgid "Every error value is printed as an #N/A error."
msgstr "Varje felvärde skrivs ut som felet #N/A."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:514
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Errors</guilabel> selection box allows you to choose how to "
"print error values: <_:variablelist-1/>"
msgstr ""
"I listrutan <guilabel>Fel</guilabel> väljer du hur felvärden ska skrivas ut:"
" <_:variablelist-1/>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:554
msgid ""
"Finally you can decide about the direction in which the workbook will be "
"printed (Down, then right or Right, then down)."
msgstr ""
"Slutligen kan du välja i vilken ordning arbetsboken ska skrivas ut: nedåt "
"och sedan åt höger, eller åt höger och sedan nedåt."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:566
msgid ""
"The <interface>Print Preview Dialog</interface> is used to display what the "
"printed output will look like. The <interface>Print Preview "
"dialog</interface> can be used to check whether you have the desired "
"formatting and layout before you print out the workbook. "
"<application>Evince</application> is set up to be the default viewer."
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan <interface>Förhandsgranska utskrift</interface> visar hur "
"utskriften kommer att se ut. Använd dialogrutan <interface>Förhandsgranska "
"utskrift</interface> för att kontrollera att formatering och layout är rätt "
"innan du skriver ut arbetsboken. <application>Evince</application> är "
"standardvisare."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:575
msgid "Customizing the preview application"
msgstr "Anpassa förhandsgranskningsprogrammet"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:585
msgid ""
"Please make sure you have only one line defining your preview application."
msgstr ""
"Se till att det bara finns en rad som definierar "
"förhandsgranskningsprogrammet."
